  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/17ee53f0aa3cebaac16ad79ae2fa79e562336dde52fe9a4fd41bdb0c7ce4a2a3.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n1)** + and ×**\n\n→ **56 ÷ 8** − 14 + 2 × 12 = 23\n\n→ 7 − 14 + **2 ****×**** 12** = 23\n\n→ **7** − 14 **+ 24** = 23\n\n→ 31 − 14 = 23\n\n→ 17 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n2) **− and ×**\n\n→ **56 ÷ 8** × 14 − 2 + 12 = 23\n\n→ **7 ×**** 14** − 2 + 12 = 23\n\n→ **98** − 2 **+ 12** = 23\n\n→ 110 − 2 = 23\n\n→ 108 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n3) **÷ and ×**\n\n→ 56 × 8 − **14 ÷ 2** + 12 = 23\n\n→ **56 ****× 8** − 7 + 12 = 23\n\n→ **448** − 7 **+ 12** = 23\n\n→ 460 − 7 = 23\n\n→ 453 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n4) **− and +**\n\n→ **56 ÷ 8** + 14 × 2 - 12 = 23\n\n→ 7 + **14 × 2** - 12 = 23\n\n→ **7 + 28** - 12 = 23\n\n→ 35 - 12 = 23\n\n→ 23 = 23\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ⇒ Satisfies the equation.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"− and +\"**.",
